{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_session_83_combined_handoff", "label": "Session 83 Combined Handoff", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-83-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_83_combined_g_ladder", "label": "The g-Ladder (nu = sigma - g(l), g(l) := l + delta(n,l))", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-83-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A change of coordinates, not a result. Its value is that the decision threshold becomes the pure number 1 and carries no units, where CLOSE-S78 \u00a73 had shown the eigenvalue form cannot be assumed. Licensed by s82's measured q_eff = -rV = 1.000000."}, {"id": "recovered_session_83_combined_g_within", "label": "G-within (the Tie-Break: g Increasing in l Inside a sigma-Class)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-83-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_83_combined_g_across", "label": "G-across (the n+l Ordering: max g(sigma+1) - min g(sigma) < 1)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-83-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "recovered_session_83_combined_width_2_frontier", "label": "The Width-2 Frontier (106 of 107 Rows, Sole Exception Z=90)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/SESSION-83-COMBINED.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No clean width exists - 43 of 107 rows fail at width 6+ - but the relaxed field is Madelung-ordered at 106 of 107 on the two lowest-nu channels per row. The global statement is measurably FALSE and the derivation never needed i